0..48 Comment "//! No layout gives two joined lamps two levels."
49..52 Comment "//!"
53..127 Comment "//! A rule joins two constants of a type. A layout that gives them two bit"
128..204 Comment "//! patterns has no proof of the rule. An encoder that names no law gives no"
205..242 Comment "//! reason for its two arms to agree."
243..246 Comment "//!"
247..324 Comment "//! The checker refuses the module that omits the law, and it names the rule."
325..398 Comment "//! It refuses the encoder over the members of a layout where the encoder"
399..416 Comment "//! names no law."
417..420 Comment "//!"
421..437 Comment "//! - see: #8333"
